
1. JENKINS BASICS

---

Jenkins is a CI/CD automation tool.

It automates tasks such as:

* Getting source code from Git/GitHub
* Installing dependencies
* Running tests
* Building applications
* Deploying applications
* Sending notifications

Jenkins can perform these tasks automatically when a configured event
occurs.

